    "https://www.kuyper.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-02-10-Bilingual-Worship-Leader-job-description.pdf": {
      "title": "Job",
      "description": "Job\n \nDescription:\n \nBilingual\n \nWorship\n \nLeader\n \nPurpose\n \nTo\n \ncollaborate\n \non\n \nplanning\n \nand\n \nleading\n \nbilingual\n \n(Spanish\n \nand\n \nEnglish)\n \nworship\n \nservices\n \nthat\n \nare\n \nGod-glorifying\n \nand\n \nedifying\n \nto\n \nour\n \ndiverse\n \ncongregation;\n \nto\n \ninvite,\n \ninvolve,\n \nand\n \ncoordinate\n \nthe\n \nefforts\n \nof\n \nthose\n \nwho\n \ncontribute\n \nto\n \nmusic\n \nleadership.\n \nThis\n \nis\n \na\n \npart-time,\n \nsix-month\n \nrenewable\n \ncontract\n \nposition\n \nrequiring\n \nan\n \naverage\n \nof\n \n10\n \nhours\n \nper\n \nweek\n \nwith\n \nsome\n \nadditional\n \nhours\n \nrequired\n \nat\n \nkey\n \ntimes\n \nin\n \nthe\n \nyear.\n \nAreas\n \nof\n \nResponsibility\n \nand\n \nLeadership\n \n●\n \nProvide\n \nmusic\n \nleadership\n \nfor\n \nbilingual\n \nworship\n \nservices\n \nas\n \nthe\n \nworship\n \nleader.\n \n●\n \nLead\n \nrehearsals\n \nof\n \nthe\n \nmusic\n \nteam.\n \n●\n \nCollaborate\n \non\n \nselecting\n \nmusic\n \nfor\n \nworship\n \nservices,\n \nboth\n \nfor\n \ncongregational\n \nsinging\n \nand\n \nfor\n \ninstrumental\n \nmusic.\n \n●\n \nFind\n \nadditional\n \nsingers\n \nand\n \nmusicians\n \nand\n \ninclude\n \nthem\n \nin\n \nleading\n \nworship\n \nas\n \nneeded.\n \n●\n \nCollaborate\n \non\n \nwriting\n \nand\n \nleading\n \nliturgies\n \nfor\n \nboth\n \nthe\n \nbilingual\n \nand\n \ncombined\n \nworship\n \nservices.\n \n●\n \nCreate\n \nPowerPoint\n \nslideshows\n \nfor\n \nprojecting\n \nmusic\n \nand\n \nliturgies\n \nfor\n \nworship\n \nservices.\n \n●\n \nDevelop\n \nthe\n \nbulletin\n \nor\n \nother\n \nprint\n \nmaterials\n \nfor\n \nbilingual\n \nservices.\n \n●\n \nFilm\n \nand\n \nedit\n \nvideo\n \nfor\n \nonline\n \nworship\n \nservices\n \nas\n \nneeded.\n \n●\n \nAttend\n \nWorship\n \nCommittee\n \nand\n \nWorship\n \nPlanning\n \nTeam\n \nmeetings\n \nand\n \ncollaborate\n \nwith\n \ncommittee\n \nmembers\n \nin\n \ncreating\n \nworship\n \nexperiences\n \nthat\n \ninspire\n \nspiritual\n \ngrowth.\n \n●\n \nOther\n \nduties\n \nas\n \nassigned.\n \nRelationships\n \n●\n \nReports\n \nto\n \nthe\n \nLead\n \nPastor\n \n●\n \nSupervised\n \nby\n \nthe\n \nBilingual\n \nPastor\n \n●\n \nServes\n \nas\n \nstaff\n \nsupport\n \nfor\n \nother\n \nworship\n \nneeds\n \nas\n \ndetermined\n \nby\n \nthe\n \nRenewing\n \nWorship\n \nTeam\n \nQualifications\n \n●\n \nA\n \ntransformational\n \nlove\n \nof\n \nJesus\n \nChrist\n \n●\n \nEnthusiasm\n \nfor\n \nurban\n \nministry\n \nthrough\n \nmusic\n \nand\n \nworship\n \n●\n \nCommitment\n \nto\n \nEastern\n \nAvenue\n \nChurch,\n \nits\n \nvision\n \nfor\n \nministry,\n \nand\n \nthe\n \nReformed\n \nfaith\n \ntradition\n \n●\n \nMusic\n \nskills,\n \nboth\n \ninstrumental\n \nand\n \nvocal\n \n●\n \nCross-cultural\n \ncompetency\n \n●\n \nExcellent\n \ntime\n \nmanagement\n \nand\n \norganizational\n \nskills\n \n●\n \nA\n \nteam\n \nplayer\n \n●\n \nEffective\n \nwritten,\n \nverbal,\n \nand\n \ndigital\n \ncommunication\n \nJob\n \nDescription:\n \nBilingual\n \nWorship\n \nLeader,\n \nFebruary\n \n10,\n \n2026\n     \n1\n \n●\n \nAbility\n \nto\n \nmake\n \nproactive\n \nindependent\n \ndecisions\n \n●\n \nDemonstrates\n \npositive\n \nconflict\n \nresolution\n \nabilities\n \nEducation\n \nand\n \nExperience\n \n●\n \nExperience\n \nin\n \ncreating\n \nand\n \nleading\n \nworship\n \n●\n \nDegree\n \nin\n \nmusic\n \nministry\n \nor\n \nworship\n \nleadership\n \npreferred,\n \nor\n \nequivalent\n \nexperience\n \n●\n \nBilingual\n \nin\n \nSpanish\n \nand\n \nEnglish\n \nrequired,\n \nnative\n \nSpanish\n \nspeaker\n \npreferred\n \nCompensation\n \n●\n \nCommensurate\n \nwith\n \nexperience\n \n(starting\n \nat\n \n$20.00\n \nper\n \nhour)\n \nBenefits\n \n●\n \nProfessional\n \ndevelopment\n \nopportunities\n \nJob\n \nDescription:\n \nBilingual\n \nWorship\n \nLeader,\n \nFebruary\n \n10,\n \n2026\n     \n2\n "
